"cne_j148","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"孤独的老人需要什么，哪一句说得清楚？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"They need someone talk to."},{"key":"B","text":"They need someone to talking to."},{"key":"C","text":"They need someone for talk."},{"key":"D","text":"They need someone to talk to."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"someone to talk to。","verify":"\"They need someone to talk to.\""},{"id":"cne_j148_q4","topicId":"cne_j148","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"I'll help to clean up the park. 这句是在做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"提出帮忙打扫公园"},{"key":"B","text":"拒绝打扫"},{"key":"C","text":"询问公园在哪里"},{"key":"D","text":"比较两座公园"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"I'll help to 表示愿意帮忙。","verify":"\"提出帮忙打扫公园\""},{"id":"cne_j149_q1","topicId":"cne_j149","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"We need volunteers to clean up the city park on Saturday. Please call Mr. Li. 需要志愿者做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"建造医院"},{"key":"B","text":"卖票"},{"key":"C","text":"打扫城市公园"},{"key":"D","text":"开车"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"clean up the city park。","verify":"\"打扫城市公园\""},{"id":"cne_j149_q2","topicId":"cne_j149","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"We need volunteers to clean up the city park on Saturday. 在星期几？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"星期日"},{"key":"B","text":"星期一"},{"key":"C","text":"星期五"},{"key":"D","text":"星期六"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"on Saturday。","verify":"\"星期六\""},{"id":"cne_j149_q3","topicId":"cne_j149","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Anna wants to help. She will give out notices after school. 她放学后做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"发通知"},{"key":"B","text":"打扫自己的房间"},{"key":"C","text":"去看病"},{"key":"D","text":"待在家里"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"give out notices。","verify":"\"发通知\""},{"id":"cne_j149_q4","topicId":"cne_j149","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Anna wants to help. She will give out notices after school. 哪一句和短文一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Anna will not help."},{"key":"B","text":"Anna will hand out notices after school."},{"key":"C","text":"The park clean-up is on Monday."},{"key":"D","text":"Mr. Li will give out food at the hospital."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"give out notices after school。","verify":"\"Anna will hand out notices after school.\""},{"id":"cne_j183_q1","topicId":"cne_j183","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词的意思是「围巾」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"scarf"},{"key":"B","text":"soft"},{"key":"C","text":"yard"},{"key":"D","text":"honest"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"scarf 的意思是围巾。","verify":"\"scarf\""},{"id":"cne_j183_q2","topicId":"cne_j183","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"「soft」的中文意思是哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"围巾"},{"key":"B","text":"柔软的"},{"key":"C","text":"院子"},{"key":"D","text":"诚实的"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"soft 的意思是柔软的。","verify":"\"柔软的\""},{"id":"cne_j183_q3","topicId":"cne_j183","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"选择表示「院子」的单词。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"scarf"},{"key":"B","text":"soft"},{"key":"C","text":"yard"},{"key":"D","text":"honest"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"表示院子的单词是 yard。","verify":"\"yard\""},{"id":"cne_j183_q4","topicId":"cne_j183","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词的意思是「诚实的」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"scarf"},{"key":"B","text":"soft"},{"key":"C","text":"yard"},{"key":"D","text":"honest"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"honest 的意思是诚实的。","verify":"\"honest\""},{"id":"cne_j184_q1","topicId":"cne_j184","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"这辆自行车我买了三年了。哪一句正确？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I have had this bike since three years."},{"key":"B","text":"I have had this bike for three years."},{"key":"C","text":"I have bought this bike for three years."},{"key":"D","text":"I have had this bike for three years ago."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"for three years 是一段时间。have had 可以和 for 连用。","verify":"\"I have had this bike for three years.\""},{"id":"cne_j184_q2","topicId":"cne_j184","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"从 2019 年起我就住在这里。哪一句正确？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I have lived here for 2019."},{"key":"B","text":"I have lived here since three years."},{"key":"C","text":"I have lived here since 2019."},{"key":"D","text":"I lived here since 2019 and I do not live here now."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"since 2019 是起点。","verify":"\"I have lived here since 2019.\""},{"id":"cne_j184_q3","topicId":"cne_j184","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"for 后面通常接什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"一个过去的年份"},{"key":"B","text":"一个星期几的名称单独作起点"},{"key":"C","text":"一个最高级"},{"key":"D","text":"一段时间"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"for three years、for two hours 都是一段时间。","verify":"\"一段时间\""},{"id":"cne_j184_q4","topicId":"cne_j184","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"他从星期一就病了，到现在还病着。哪一句正确？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"He has been ill since Monday."},{"key":"B","text":"He has been ill for Monday."},{"key":"C","text":"He was ill since Monday and he is well now in this sentence."},{"key":"D","text":"He has been ill since three days."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"since Monday 表示从星期一开始一直到现在。","verify":"\"He has been ill since Monday.\""},{"id":"cne_j185_q1","topicId":"cne_j185","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"想问对方拥有这条围巾多久了，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"How long have you bought this scarf?"},{"key":"B","text":"How long did you have this scarf next year?"},{"key":"C","text":"How long have you had this scarf?"},{"key":"D","text":"How long have you has this scarf?"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"延续到现在用 have you had，不用 have you bought。","verify":"\"How long have you had this scarf?\""},{"id":"cne_j185_q2","topicId":"cne_j185","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"你拥有两年了，应怎么说？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I have had it since two years."},{"key":"B","text":"I have bought it for two years."},{"key":"C","text":"I had it for two years and I sold it."},{"key":"D","text":"I have had it for two years."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"for two years。","verify":"\"I have had it for two years.\""},{"id":"cne_j185_q3","topicId":"cne_j185","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Since when have you lived in this yard? 这句在问什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"你从何时起住在这个院子里"},{"key":"B","text":"院子有多大"},{"key":"C","text":"你昨天住不住"},{"key":"D","text":"院子软不软"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"Since when 问起始时间。","verify":"\"你从何时起住在这个院子里\""},{"id":"cne_j185_q4","topicId":"cne_j185","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"想说玩具熊又软又旧，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"The bear is soft and old for since."},{"key":"B","text":"The bear is soft and old."},{"key":"C","text":"The bear are soft and old."},{"key":"D","text":"The bear is a old soft."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"is soft and old。","verify":"\"The bear is soft and old.\""},{"id":"cne_j186_q1","topicId":"cne_j186","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"I have had this scarf for three years. My grandma made it. 围巾是谁做的？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"妈妈"},{"key":"B","text":"同学"},{"key":"C","text":"售货员"},{"key":"D","text":"奶奶"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"My grandma made it。","verify":"\"奶奶\""},{"id":"cne_j186_q2","topicId":"cne_j186","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"I have had this scarf for three years. 拥有多久了？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"三年"},{"key":"B","text":"三个月"},{"key":"C","text":"从昨天开始"},{"key":"D","text":"短文没说"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"for three years。","verify":"\"三年\""},{"id":"cne_j186_q3","topicId":"cne_j186","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Jeff has owned the bike since he was ten. He still rides it. 他现在还骑这辆车吗？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"已经卖掉了"},{"key":"B","text":"还骑"},{"key":"C","text":"从未拥有"},{"key":"D","text":"只在十岁前骑"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"still rides it。","verify":"\"还骑\""},{"id":"cne_j186_q4","topicId":"cne_j186","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Jeff has owned the bike since he was ten. 哪一句和短文一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Jeff has had the bike for ten days only."},{"key":"B","text":"Jeff sold the bike."},{"key":"C","text":"Jeff got the bike when he was ten and still has it."},{"key":"D","text":"The scarf is three days old."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"since he was ten，而且 still rides。","verify":"\"Jeff got the bike when he was ten and still has it.\""}]
